  <section id="what-callteam-does" class="about-definition-section">
    <div class="container about-copy">
      <div class="section-label">CallTeam in simple English</div>
      <h2>We help B2B companies find the right buyers, start real conversations, and create a useful next step.</h2>
      <p>Some companies call this B2B lead generation. Others search for a cold calling company, an appointment-setting company, an outsourced SDR provider, an AI GTM partner, or a sales training company. CallTeam connects those jobs inside one operating model.</p>
      <p>We help define the target market, identify relevant accounts and decision-makers, prepare the outreach, make the calls, handle follow-up, qualify the opportunity, book the meeting, update the CRM, and transfer useful context to the sales team. When the problem is inside the team or the wider revenue system, CallTeam can also train sellers, improve management behavior, and rebuild the operating process.</p>
      <p>The objective is not activity for its own sake. The objective is more qualified B2B sales conversations and better evidence about the market, message, buyer, and next step.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

