      <div class="about-copy-stack">
        <p>The leadership and operating experience behind CallTeam was shaped through nearly two decades of financial services, enterprise sales, outbound programs, sales management, seller coaching, entrepreneurship, and work inside demanding Fortune 100 and Fortune 500 environments.</p>
        <p>That background matters because B2B outbound is not learned from a script alone. It is learned through real calls, difficult objections, complex offers, missed meetings, weak lists, changing markets, coaching conversations, and the discipline to turn activity into evidence.</p>
